{"repo": {"timestamp": 1790329552000, "version": 20002, "name": "Forkray", "icon": "icon.png", "address": "https://acidefluorhydrique.github.io/v2rayNG/repo", "description": "Forkray, a fork of v2rayNG, compiled from source on GitHub Actions. Every release publishes a build manifest with the exact sources, toolchain and checksums, so it can be rebuilt and compared. Source: https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG"}, "requests": {"install": [], "uninstall": []}, "apps": [{"authorName": "AcideFluorhydrique (fork of v2rayNG by 2dust)", "categories": ["Internet"], "changelog": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/releases", "suggestedVersionCode": "5074904", "issueTracker": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG/issues", "license": "GPL-3.0-only", "sourceCode": "https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG", "added": 1790329551000, "packageName": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng", "lastUpdated": 1790329552000, "localized": {"en-US": {"description": "<p>Forkray is a fork of <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG\">v2rayNG</a>, the V2Ray client for Android, supporting <a href=\"https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core\">Xray core</a>. It follows every upstream v2rayNG release and keeps its features and settings.</p>\n\n<h3>How it differs from v2rayNG</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Built entirely from source on public CI, including the Xray core, which upstream downloads as a prebuilt library. Every release publishes the exact sources, toolchain and checksums used, so it can be rebuilt and compared byte for byte.</li>\n<li>Its own application ID, so it installs alongside v2rayNG rather than replacing it.</li>\n<li>No in-app update check (your F-Droid client handles updates) and no promotion link.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Geoip and Geosite</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>geoip.dat and geosite.dat are in <code>Android/data/io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng/files/assets</code> (the path may differ on some devices).</li>\n<li>The download feature fetches the enhanced version from <a href=\"https://github.com/Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat\">Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat</a>; it needs a working proxy.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Source code and issues: <a href=\"https://github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG\">github.com/AcideFluorhydrique/v2rayNG</a>. Documentation for the shared features: the <a href=\"https://github.com/2dust/v2rayNG/wiki\">v2rayNG wiki</a>.</p>\n", "icon": "icon_6z4MS1fuvJIzlohfY_TaMDs7gYwsJz-3fNfrokpTG9k=.png", "name": "Forkray", "summary": "A V2Ray client for Android, forked from v2rayNG and built from source"}}}], "packages": {"io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng": [{"added": 1790329552000, "apkName": "v2rayNG_2.3.9-fdroid_x86.apk", "hash": "67286a6e50650ac3420fda62d4470c5858ab65c42bf34b42d2b63ef3b491fa2f", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["x86"], "packageName": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng", "sig": "1a1a05eaa045f943e4416e9dea32932c", "signer": "561d282e03be3557d09073fc317fcc2f4d3231fa26da662e290222f4b34f78d9", "size": 34391550, "targetSdkVersion": 37, "uses-permission": [["android.permission.QUERY_ALL_PACKAGES", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.CHANGE_NETWORK_STATE", null], ["android.permission.ACCESS_LOCAL_NETWORK", null], ["android.permission.INTERNET", null], ["android.permission.CAMERA", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE", null], ["android.permission.FOREGROUND_SERVICE_SPECIAL_USE", null], ["android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS", null], ["android.permission.RECEIVE_BOOT_COMPLETED", null], ["android.permission.WAKE_LOCK", null], ["io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION", null]], "versionCode": 5074904, "versionName": "2.3.9"}, {"added": 1790329552000, "apkName": "v2rayNG_2.3.9-fdroid_x86_64.apk", "hash": "7a12fb7a2088e732d66029801ba63cf30cf1ed22601bc968eb89e36bb0159113", "hashType": "sha256", "minSdkVersion": 24, "nativecode": ["x86_64"], "packageName": "io.github.acidefluorhydrique.v2rayng", "sig